Package: querra-fence-panel
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Cosmin B. Memetea <CosminBMemetea@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: curl, bash, python3
Recommends: chromium-browser | chromium | firefox, libnotify-bin, zenity
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/CosminBMemetea/querra-fence
Description: Querra Fence panel launcher for the Jetson desktop
 Adds a "Querra Fence" app to the GNOME dock. One click starts the QUERRA
 Fence panel if it is not running (same command as its boot crontab line)
 and opens it in an app window. Desktop actions start the ROS 2 demo and
 show the Foxglove address. The panel itself is not installed or changed;
 field-mode autostart is left as it is.
